                                            ⬇ Download PDF
                                        </a>
                                        <a href="/agreements/<%- Number($agrRow?.['id']) %>?print=1" target="_blank" class="inline-block px-3 py-1.5 bg-obsidian text-ivory text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-bronze transition">
                                            🖨 Print / View
                                        </a>
                                        <a href="/agreements/<%- Number($agrRow?.['id']) %>/download" class="inline-block px-3 py-1.5 border border-obsidian text-obsidian text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-obsidian hover:text-ivory transition">
                                            ⬇ HTML
